{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46224","headline":"感怀寄卢给事二首 一 · 贯休","name":"感怀寄卢给事二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"緜緜远念近来多，喜鹊随函到绿萝。\n虽匪二贤曾入洛，忽惊六义减沈疴。\n童扳邻杏隳墙瓦，燕啄花泥落砌莎。\n好更因人寄消息，沃州归去已蹉跎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}